<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Group, Transwater suspended.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Group, Transwater suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Berjaya Group Bhd and Transwater Corp Bhd have been suspended on Wednesday at the companies' requests, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the companies could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>Berjaya Group is a diversified firm. Its stock closed on Tuesday at 1.75 ringgit.</p>
<p>Transwater, an engineering firm, closed at 107.00 ringgit on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
